// kyoten::frame::Pose — a position and an orientation, as an XR device's pose is (an OpenXR action space, located at a
// time): what a `Pose` action holds (components § Decided, step 5 question 6). It is built and bound by nothing until XR
// brings a device (KYR-34; design/input.md § Decided, 2026-11-22). Y up, right-handed, metres, as every position is.

import { std::math::Vec3, std::math::Quat };

export { Pose };

type value Pose {
    public Vec3 position;
    public Quat orientation;

    // At the origin, turned as the world is: what a pose action reads before any input.
    public default ctor identity() {
        this.position = Vec3.zero();
        this.orientation = Quat.identity();
    }
}
